ongoing $40 million cost reduction program and our planned exit of approximately $250 million in undifferentiated copper cable product lines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/belden-bdc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BDC 2019 Q4","e":"bdc","d":"2020-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Stroup","x":"We are on track to realize at least $20 million in savings under our $40 million SG&A cost reduction program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/belden-bdc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BDC 2020 Q1","e":"bdc","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Stroup","x":"This includes upsizing our existing cost reduction program, harvesting working capital and implementing compensation reductions for our senior leaders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/belden-bdc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BDC 2020 Q1","e":"bdc","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Stroup","x":"These include the divestiture of Grass Valley, the $40 million cost reduction plan and the planned exit of approximately $250 million in undifferentiated copper cable product lines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/belden-bdc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BDC 2020 Q4","e":"bdc","d":"2021-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Roel Vestjens","x":"We have the ability to pass it on to our customers, oftentimes through contractual agreements or oftentimes through price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/belden-inc-bdc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2020 Q4","e":"bdc","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roel Vestjens","x":"This includes streamlining our cost structure, funding our compelling growth initiatives, and significantly improving our portfolio of businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/belden-inc-bdc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2020 Q4","e":"bdc","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roel Vestjens","x":"As we executed these cost reduction plans, we continue to make strategic investments to accelerate growth and capitalize on the opportunities in our key markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/belden-inc-bdc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2021 Q1","e":"bdc","d":"2021-05-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Roel Vestjens","x":"Broadband networks will need to be upgraded continuously to support high-definition video consumption, streaming, virtual reality, work from home, virtual learning, etc. Demand is only accelerating and there is clear momentum behind providing high-speed broadband access to every household.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/belden-inc-bdc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2021 Q1","e":"bdc","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Parks","x":"In the first quarter, the pass-through of higher copper prices had an unfavorable impact of approximately 180 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/belden-inc-bdc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2021 Q1","e":"bdc","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Parks","x":"The pass-through of higher copper prices had an unfavorable impact of approximately 70 basis points in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/belden-inc-bdc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2021 Q1","e":"bdc","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Roel Vestjens","x":"We are off to a great start in 2021, and we are increasing our full year guidance to reflect the better-than-expected performance in the first quarter and an improved outlook for the remainder of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/belden-inc-bdc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2021 Q1","e":"bdc","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Roel Vestjens","x":"We are taking bold actions to drive substantially improved business performance and you are seeing that in our better-than-expected first quarter performance and increased full year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/belden-inc-bdc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2021 Q2","e":"bdc","d":"2021-08-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Roel Vestjens","x":"Broadband networks will need to be upgraded continuously to support high-definition video streaming, work from home, virtual learning, and many other applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/belden-inc-bdc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2021 Q2","e":"bdc","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeremy E. Parks","x":"In the second quarter, the pass-through of higher copper prices had an unfavorable impact of 320 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/belden-inc-bdc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2021 Q2","e":"bdc","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeremy E. Parks","x":"Excluding the impact of this pass-through, gross profit margins would have increased 350 basis points year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/belden-inc-bdc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2021 Q2","e":"bdc","d":"2021-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Roel Vestjens","x":"We are increasing our full year guidance to reflect the better-than-expected performance in the second quarter and an improved outlook for the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/belden-inc-bdc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2021 Q2","e":"bdc","d":"2021-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Roel Vestjens","x":"We are taking bold actions to drive substantially improved business performance, and you are seeing that in our much better-than-expected first half performance and increased full year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/belden-inc-bdc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2021 Q3","e":"bdc","d":"2021-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Parks","x":"In the third quarter, the pass-through of higher copper prices had an unfavorable impact of 210 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/belden-inc-bdc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2021 Q3","e":"bdc","d":"2021-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Parks","x":"Excluding the impact of this pass-through gross profit margins would have increased 290 basis points year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/belden-inc-bdc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2021 Q3","e":"bdc","d":"2021-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Roel Vestjens","x":"We are increasing our guidance once again.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/belden-inc-bdc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2025 Q4","e":"bdc","d":"2026-02-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ashish Chand","x":"So we see that, you know, integrated white space/gray space opportunity for data centers, especially for the AI data centers, as a very significant opportunity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/belden-bdc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2025 Q4","e":"bdc","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Parks","x":"As we discussed throughout the year, we proactively managed pricing in 2025 to offset the impact of copper inflation and tariffs and protect our overall profitability and earnings per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/belden-bdc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2025 Q4","e":"bdc","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Parks","x":"Margins improved by 50 basis points to 21% reflecting our effective management of the pass-throughs of tariffs and copper.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/belden-bdc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2025 Q4","e":"bdc","d":"2026-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Parks","x":"Despite a full recovery of these incremental costs, the pass-through actions resulted in some dilution to reported margin percentages and somewhat obscured our strong underlying operating performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/belden-bdc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2025 Q4","e":"bdc","d":"2026-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Parks","x":"We will keep passing it on in terms of price, and we do not expect it to have a major impact on end demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/belden-bdc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2025 Q4","e":"bdc","d":"2026-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ashish Chand","x":"So to me, you know, to be fair, Will, when we planned this realignment, one of our goals was not necessarily cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/belden-bdc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2025 Q4","e":"bdc","d":"2026-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ashish Chand","x":"So the goal really is not to, you know, model some kind of restructuring saving at this point.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/belden-bdc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2026 Q1","e":"bdc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ashish Chand","x":"So, Will, we do see AI data centers as one of our top growth opportunities over the next few years, but of course, along with physical AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/belden-bdc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2026 Q1","e":"bdc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ashish Chand","x":"But as you get more AI data center capacity, it enables eventually more physical AI in the field.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/belden-bdc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2026 Q1","e":"bdc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ashish Chand","x":"As we discussed last quarter, we continue to pass through copper and tariff-related costs, which modestly diluted our reported margin percentages.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/belden-bdc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2026 Q1","e":"bdc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Parks","x":"And I think we've been successful passing those on as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/belden-bdc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2026 Q1","e":"bdc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Parks","x":"The legacy Belden business does not really have much exposure to some of these memory price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/belden-bdc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2026 Q3","e":"bdc","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ashish Chand","x":"Organic revenue growth was 11% for the quarter, led by Automation and Smart Buildings, which were both up double digits, reflecting continued strength in discrete manufacturing, energy, and our AI data center strategy gaining traction with customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/belden-bdc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BDC 2026 Q3","e":"bdc","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"mana